WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:23.400
Last day.


00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:24.800
So it is.


00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:21.600
Sorry, boys,
there's been a delay.


00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:23.600
Where the fuck's Bradley?


00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:25.700
He's taking care of shit
at the airport.


00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:28.200
We've got a flight
to Mexico City to catch.


00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:30.100
Negative.
We've got a delay.


00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:32.500
Why don't you guys
hole up in town for a little bit?


00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.100
There's a nice little bar there.


00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.600
We'll meet you at 1800 hours.


00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.700
Got it. l'll tell Bradley
to meet us there.


00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:39.400
Until then.


00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:11.600
Mm, Fields.


00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.100
Here you go.


00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:17.100
Nice.


00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:19.000
Hell, something
smells good there.


00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.400
The woman sure can cook.


00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:24.000
You got yourself
a lady in the kitchen?


00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:26.200
Maybe.


00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:28.500
Well, the way you're eating
that burrito,


00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.000
you should marry her.


00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:31.800
Why not?


00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:33.300
Nobody cooks
that good, man.


00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:36.100
Yeah, but you'd have someone to go
home to every night. Think about it.


00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:37.700
l'd just get bored.


00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:40.400
Yeah, well, being bored,
that's the secret,


00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:43.700
l think-- bored,
but being happy, like me.


00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.000
You're happy?


00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:47.300
Yeah. Don't l look happy?


00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:49.000
An exciting life


00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.800
is a good way
to get yourself killed.


00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:52.800
Remember that.


00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:58.000
- You heard?
- All right. Hey, you want one?


00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.600
No way.


00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.200
How are you doing?


00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:43.500
Open it up.


00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:55.400
HSO team just rolled in.


00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:57.400
l said we'd meet them in 10,
at 1800.


00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:59.500
Yeah, but oddly enough,
transport still hasn't shown up.


00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.400
We're waiting
on the marshals again.


00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:03.300
We're waiting on
the fucking bus?


00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:04.400
Guess so.


00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:06.200
God damn it.


00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:08.500
l still can't believe l let you
convince me to come here


00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:10.500
to shut down
a couple of bullshit buildings.


00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:12.700
l usually make
the mess, brother.


00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:14.600
You got me
cleaning this one up.


00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.400
See, the thing of it is,
you're getting old, man.


00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:17.700
l got to let you down easy.


00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:21.100
But the thing of it is, when l want
somebody to cover my back,


00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:22.600
you're my man.


00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:24.500
All our guys--
they're the best.


00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:27.900
The way l look at it, you'll be
down in Mexico in the next few days


00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:30.500
and there's 4,000 ways
to get killed down there,


00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:32.200
so watch your ass.


00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:34.200
Thanks for trying
to cheer me up.


00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:38.100
Last time was a real
clusterfuck, wasn't it?


00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:40.600
- Lost some damn good men.
- Yeah.


00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:43.300
Army brass should have never
pulled us out of that shithole.


00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.100
Man, why do you act
so surprised?


00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:47.900
That's the way all these highfalutin
military pricks is, man.


00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.600
You know that.


00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:52.000
We're the first guys
that they piss on.


00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:55.700
Anyway, next week
you'll get some payback, man.


00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:57.200
And speaking of pricks...


00:07:57.200 --> 00:08:00.700
Every time l get another stack
of bullshit paperwork,


00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:02.700
your fingerprints
are all over it, Cross.


00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:05.400
Yeah, l thought your job
was bullshit paperwork.


00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.100
- Shut up.
- Negative, Warden.


00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:08.600
l ain't got to shut up.


00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:10.500
Go hide behind your desk.
We're done here.


00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:12.500
- No, you're not.
- We kind of are, man,


00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:15.400
'cause this bitch
is fully decommissioned.


00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:17.400
l took us off the grid, man--


00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:20.500
computers, satellites, phones--
everything.


00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.600
Transport will be here soon
to get the detainees.


00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:24.600
We're done.


00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:27.000
No, you booked in two more
high-security assets last night.


00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.700
You reopened block D


00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:31.000
right after you and Manning
permanently shut it down.


00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:33.600
See, you have to
understand something--


00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:36.100
this is a black site,


00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:38.800
specifically designed
for people of interest.


00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:41.400
No, no, no, it was a black site,
Cross-- was.


00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:45.100
You security contractors--
you're all the same.


00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:48.500
You think you're hot shit ex-soldiers,
big fucking heroes.


00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.300
Well, you're a pain in my ass.


00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:52.700
We already had four people
of special interest here.


00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:54.900
We don't have enough MPs
to legally hold


00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:56.700
all the fucking interesting
people we got,


00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:58.900
let alone the two
who came in last night.


00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:01.500
When you signed those two in last
night, you took authority over them.


00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:04.400
That means signing them out
will be your job, not mine.


00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:06.400
l would enjoy the process.


00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:09.600
Well, the transfer unit's late,
so you're going nowhere


00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:12.800
till all the detainees have cleared
the gate on the way out.


00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:19.400
Step away from the bars.


00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:21.600
Detainees, step back.


00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:23.600
Let me out!


00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:29.300
Detainees, step back.


00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.300
What the fuck?


00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.300
Fucking liars!


00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.800
l'm gonna fucking kill you guys!


00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:40.600
l'll fucking kill you all!


00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:48.700
Chow. Bring him in.


00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:50.900
Fuck you.
l'm not eating that shit.


00:10:50.900 --> 00:10:52.700
Don't ever touch me.


00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:56.600
Code red.
Backup in the courtyard.


00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:59.700
Repeat, backup in the courtyard!
Code red.


00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.700
Fucking killers!


00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:18.100
Open the courtyard gate.


00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:22.000
Open the courtyard.


00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:31.200
What's the problem, man?
What's the problem?


00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:39.800
Come on, man.
Want something?


00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:43.600
Boss. Okay, boss.


00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:50.800
- You all right?
- Fuck you.


00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:54.200
Sir, l found this kite
in the corridor.


00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:56.500
l don't know if the inmates
are trying to communicate,


00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:58.000
but l thought
you should know.


00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:00.300
All right.


00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:02.000
Be cool.


00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:08.200
l'ma get you.
Fuck you. l'ma get you.


00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:16.400
Let me see that.


00:13:29.900 --> 00:13:31.800
The name on the manifest
says Rick.


00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:34.200
The name tag says Max.
You want to explain that?


00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:37.400
The truck rolled
over his foot yesterday.


00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:40.800
Um, l usually work dispatch.


00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:42.900
Short-staffed, so...


00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:45.000
Almost wrapped up here,
so let's get it done.


00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:48.700
Sorry, you know, l was trying
to sneak in a bit of overtime.


00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:51.700
Wife's birthday,
you know, coming up.


00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:53.800
Why don't we catch up
some other time, all right?


00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:57.100
Just get on with your job
so l can get the fuck out of here.


00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:05.000
Sanders, guard the fort.


00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:25.900
- Don't tell me you fucked this up.
- l don't know.


00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:27.700
All you had to do
was push a goddamn button.


00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.900
Sounds like
something snapped.


00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.100
Something snapped?
ls that your professional opinion


00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:34.200
or just a wild fucking guess?


00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:39.900
Shit, l'm gonna die of old age
in this motherfucker.


00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:42.500
Get the truck, pull it out.
We need to take a look.


00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:44.400
Pull it out.


00:14:56.400 --> 00:14:58.400
Kill it. Kill it.


00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:02.000
l'm smelling diesel out here.


00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:04.000
The truck won't disengage.


00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.100
Something's definitely stuck
back there.


00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:08.600
You might want to call your buddies to
come down here and give you some help.


00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:10.800
Yeah, good luck with that.


00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:14.000
Friday night-- everyone's
packed out till Monday.


00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:16.200
Shit.


00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:19.200
l got it.


00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:24.600
l'll see what l can do.


00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:33.000
Hey, bud, it's Manning.


00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:35.300
Hey, listen, we've got an issue
with the garbage truck.


00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:38.700
Something's jammed in there
and l'm smelling diesel fumes.


00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:41.300
Well, you know, block D
is on the same ventilation system


00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:42.700
as maintenance.


00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:45.600
Yes, sir, same place you booked in
two assets last night.


00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:47.700
Fuck. l'm gonna head
down there right now.


00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:50.400
Anyway, l'll take care of it.


00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:52.900
l don't think either of us
is gonna make it out of here tonight.


00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:56.200
Wonderful.


00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:05.500
l was about to contact you
on the radio, sir.


00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:07.500
l'm smelling diesel
down here.


00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:10.100
Yeah, l know. l'm moving
the detainees as we speak.


00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:13.300
- Where are we gonna put them?
- Unfortunately, block G.


00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:15.000
Seriously?


00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:18.000
Those fucking guys are gonna go crazy
when they know about them.


00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:19.900
Unfortunately, l don't have
much of a choice.


00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:21.800
You know, it's only
for a couple of hours.


00:16:21.800 --> 00:16:23.700
Everybody's transferring
out tonight.


00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:25.700
So let's just do it.


00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:33.100
All right, girls,
let's go for a walk.


00:16:38.900 --> 00:16:41.100
Let's see your hands, girls.


00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:44.300
Please listen to me.


00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:46.200
l'm a foreign national.


00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:48.200
My government
has no idea where l am.


00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:51.000
Right.
And you're a political prisoner.


00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:53.000
l know.
l've heard that before, man.


00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:55.800
Every motherfucker in here
that's wrapped in skin


00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:57.300
is a political prisoner.


00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:59.800
l'm no idiot, okay?
l know what this place is


00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:02.100
and l know where
guys like you come from.


00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:04.600
lf you don't help me,
then l'm dead.


00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:06.600
Went in the boiler room,
grabbed some tools.


00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:09.800
l went ahead and shut the heat down
to G block while l was there, FYl.


00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:12.600
Sure got some ugly janitors
in this dump.


00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:15.200
- Who let the hooker in?
- Fuck you.


00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:16.700
l did.


00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:22.400
You deal with your mess.


00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:25.100
l've got a garbage truck with my name
on it waiting for me.


00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:26.900
Call me.


00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:28.900
lt was ClA this time.


00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:30.500
Please listen to me.


00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:32.400
Look, l'm a courier.


00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:34.700
My contact was
assassinated right in--


00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:36.800
ln private.


00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:38.200
This time it was ClA.


00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:40.400
Look, l'm not bullshitting you.


00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:42.600
l'm trying to tell you
that if you don't listen to me,


00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:44.800
if you don't help me,
then l'm dead. l'm--


00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:47.800
You just gotta stop talking
in front of people.


00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:52.900
Please tell me you know
what the hell you're doing in there.


00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:58.800
What's your ETA, man?


00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:01.200
lt's gonna be a while.


00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:03.800
The prisoners are locked
and secured in block G.


00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:06.600
l'm meeting the team.
l've got something to run by Bradley.


00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:11.000
Radio me if the transfer unit
shows up.


00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:12.000
Will do.


00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:19.000
Well, fuck me.


00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:23.600
Man, we ain't never getting out
of here at this rate.


00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.000
l'll take a look.


00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:58.800
Target in place.
Commence extraction.


00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:10.300
Come on, boss,
have a drink.


00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:13.100
These ladies have been waiting
for you and Manning all day.


00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:18.100
Oh, thank you.


00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:21.200
Where the hell is Bradley?
l gotta get back to the base.


00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:25.400
Hey, sorry l'm late.


00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:27.700
So where's Manning?


00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:29.300
l thought he was
coming with you.


00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:32.000
He's fucking around with that
trash compressor or some shit.


00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:34.500
And he's happy about it too.


00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:39.000
So l heard you might have
something for me.


00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:41.200
l've got a kite


00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:44.500
that they seem to have recovered
from one of the inmates,


00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:48.100
but l got a funny feeling that this
looks like numeric and Arabic mixed.


00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:50.600
And Arabic is your deal,


00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:53.200
so have a look at that
and l'll come down in a minute.


00:19:55.300 --> 00:19:57.400
Yeah, that's exactly
what it is.


00:19:57.400 --> 00:19:59.700
As you know,
ciphers are numeric-based,


00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:01.700
but the Arabic is unusual.


00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:04.100
Fortunately, it's one of
my specialties.


00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:17.400
Hey, the wagon
finally arrived.


00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:20.700
Looks like we're out of here
in the morning.


00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:32.300
Control unit to Manning:
transfer unit has arrived. Copy?


00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:38.400
Control unit to Manning,
transfer unit has arrived. Copy?


00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:40.200
Manning is still working
on the crusher.


00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:42.300
l'll let him know
when he comes out.


00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:44.100
Let's get Terrence on it.


00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:47.100
Terrence, this is Control.
We need you in intake.


00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:48.900
The transfer unit
is here. Copy?


00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:50.100
On my way.


00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:52.700
Wait here.


00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:21.400
lt's complicated,
but my best guess is


00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:24.100
that a dirty guard
has been passing on information.


00:21:24.100 --> 00:21:26.200
That's basically an itinerary.


00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:29.600
lt gives the exact pickup time
and the route the marshals are going to.


00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:31.800
Okay, so what
we're talking about


00:21:31.800 --> 00:21:34.600
is a high-risk extraction
in the making,


00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:36.400
and it's coming soon.


00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:38.000
We have little time.
Where is your gear?


00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:41.300
The gear's still at the airport.
l didn't think we'd need it.


00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:43.500
Well, always gotta be ready,
right?


00:21:43.600 --> 00:21:47.400
Listen, l'm gonna go brief Manning
and jump up ahead of you guys.


00:21:47.400 --> 00:21:49.400
You guys go tack up.
Meet me there.


00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:51.500
Go in the tunnels
off the motor pool


00:21:51.500 --> 00:21:54.000
and nobody will see you.


00:21:54.100 --> 00:21:55.700
Keep your eyes open,
your head on a swivel.


00:21:55.800 --> 00:21:57.500
Okay.


00:21:57.500 --> 00:21:59.500
All right, gentlemen,


00:21:59.600 --> 00:22:01.800
we got a fucking shit sandwich
coming on real fast.


00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:04.000
We need to tack up now.


00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:05.800
- Let's go.
- All right.


00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:09.600
## Happy days are here... ##


00:22:09.700 --> 00:22:11.600
All right,
let's see what you got.


00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:13.200
l don't think you can handle
what l got.


00:22:13.200 --> 00:22:14.700
Come on, bring it.


00:22:14.800 --> 00:22:16.600
Oh, damn!


00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:19.400
Now, see, that was pure luck.
A pro would never take that shot.


00:22:19.400 --> 00:22:22.700
Captain Christopher Blake,
US marshal, prisoner transfer unit.


00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:24.600
You got two female
detainees for me.


00:22:24.700 --> 00:22:27.200
Personnel, be advised,


00:22:27.300 --> 00:22:29.900
please remember
to catalogue all boxes


00:22:29.900 --> 00:22:33.100
according to the official
government itemized checklist.


00:22:34.300 --> 00:22:36.400
How's your Friday night?


00:22:40.900 --> 00:22:42.900
Yeah, this all seems in order,


00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:45.500
but there's only transfer papers
for two prisoners.


00:22:45.500 --> 00:22:48.700
