01:22:35.500 --> 01:22:38.000
lsn't that the tactical genius?


01:22:39.600 --> 01:22:41.900
l got you outmanned
and outgunned two to one.


01:22:42.000 --> 01:22:44.100
l guess you're
not so clever after all.


01:22:44.100 --> 01:22:46.500
lt ain't the amount.
lt's the skill.


01:22:46.600 --> 01:22:48.900
The skill the guy's got--
that's what it is.


01:22:49.000 --> 01:22:50.900
Save it for your girlfriend.


01:22:51.000 --> 01:22:52.700
Want to hear
something funny, though?


01:22:52.700 --> 01:22:54.900
All right.


01:22:55.000 --> 01:22:57.000
See my smiling face?


01:22:57.000 --> 01:22:59.900
lt's the last thing you're gonna see
before you hit your grave.


01:23:08.800 --> 01:23:11.800
Where are you going?
What are you gonna do?


01:23:11.800 --> 01:23:13.600
Drop your fucking weapons!


01:23:13.600 --> 01:23:16.600
- Put them down now! Put them down!
- Drop your weapons now!


01:23:16.600 --> 01:23:18.300
You motherfucker, drop it!


01:23:18.400 --> 01:23:21.200
Drop it! Drop your weapon!


01:23:40.900 --> 01:23:42.500
Cover me.


01:23:45.900 --> 01:23:47.800
l'm out.


01:23:47.800 --> 01:23:49.200
Cover him!


01:24:52.000 --> 01:24:53.500
You're dead, bitch.


01:25:04.400 --> 01:25:07.000
Keep them pinned down.
l'm gonna flank them.


01:25:07.000 --> 01:25:08.700
l'll catch you long.
Go, go, go.


01:25:28.800 --> 01:25:30.200
Motherfucker!


01:27:26.600 --> 01:27:28.900
l got four of them.
How about you?


01:27:28.900 --> 01:27:31.400
l got some myself.


01:27:33.700 --> 01:27:35.500
Look at this sorry-ass bitch.


01:27:38.200 --> 01:27:39.700
Okay.


01:27:39.700 --> 01:27:41.600
Yeah, we made it.


01:27:46.400 --> 01:27:49.900
God damn, which one of you
motherfuckers killed my future ex-wife?


01:27:52.500 --> 01:27:54.000
Cross.


01:27:56.600 --> 01:27:58.600
You're out of ammo.


01:27:58.600 --> 01:28:00.600
So am l.


01:28:02.300 --> 01:28:04.600
Why don't we talk?


01:28:11.700 --> 01:28:14.200
We've got a lot in common,
you and l--


01:28:14.200 --> 01:28:17.000
Special Forces,


01:28:17.000 --> 01:28:19.300
black ops, ClA.


01:28:19.300 --> 01:28:20.800
No, l'm not Special Forces.


01:28:20.900 --> 01:28:23.200
l was never Special Forces.
l was a Marine.


01:28:23.300 --> 01:28:25.200
Whatever.


01:28:25.200 --> 01:28:27.800
What the hell are we trying
to kill each other for, huh?


01:28:27.800 --> 01:28:31.400
This isn't about patriotism


01:28:31.400 --> 01:28:34.600
with a flag.
This is about money.


01:28:36.400 --> 01:28:38.600
You know who
Samantha's contact was?


01:28:38.600 --> 01:28:40.400
lt was a money guy.


01:28:40.400 --> 01:28:42.800
He delivered secret government funds
to favored efforts


01:28:42.900 --> 01:28:45.100
in trouble spots
around the world.


01:28:45.200 --> 01:28:48.100
He was a bag man
for the ClA


01:28:48.100 --> 01:28:50.100
delivering bribes
and payoffs.


01:28:50.100 --> 01:28:52.700
And that chip that was
implanted in her...


01:28:52.800 --> 01:28:55.100
Yeah?


01:28:55.200 --> 01:28:58.600
That contained secret
financial information.


01:28:58.600 --> 01:29:01.000
With that, we could access


01:29:01.100 --> 01:29:04.400
at least $200 million
of whitewashed money--


01:29:04.400 --> 01:29:06.800
clean money.


01:29:06.900 --> 01:29:08.700
You know what you could do
with that?


01:29:09.900 --> 01:29:13.300
You could open yourself
a free clinic in Mogadishu


01:29:13.300 --> 01:29:15.600
or an orphanage in Mexico


01:29:15.600 --> 01:29:17.700
or a bordello in Berlin--


01:29:17.700 --> 01:29:19.600
whatever the fuck you want.


01:29:19.700 --> 01:29:21.100
Right?


01:29:21.100 --> 01:29:22.300
Yeah.


01:29:22.300 --> 01:29:24.300
You and l both know


01:29:24.300 --> 01:29:26.800
this isn't about good guys
and bad guys anymore.


01:29:26.900 --> 01:29:29.800
We split that money
right down the middle.


01:29:29.900 --> 01:29:33.800
You walk away a rich guy.
l walk away a rich guy.


01:29:33.900 --> 01:29:36.800
Maybe you really would
give me $100 million.


01:29:44.000 --> 01:29:46.600
There's your act of good faith.


01:29:46.700 --> 01:29:49.500
You know, l'm just thinking
to myself


01:29:49.600 --> 01:29:53.100
that somewhere


01:29:53.100 --> 01:29:55.500
in the back of my mind,


01:29:55.600 --> 01:29:57.900
l kind of feel like


01:29:57.900 --> 01:30:01.700
you're not being
completely sincere.


01:30:08.900 --> 01:30:11.000
What, you don't trust me?


01:30:11.000 --> 01:30:13.000
Not exactly.


01:31:02.900 --> 01:31:05.300
Look at you, man.


01:31:05.300 --> 01:31:07.500
You're dead.


01:31:08.600 --> 01:31:11.900
Money can't buy life.
Money can't buy honor.


01:31:13.100 --> 01:31:15.100
You ain't got shit.


01:31:16.500 --> 01:31:19.200
l don't know what's wrong
with you, man.


01:31:20.800 --> 01:31:22.800
Now you're dead.


01:31:24.000 --> 01:31:26.500
Jeez.


01:31:28.200 --> 01:31:30.400
You talk about
being a warrior.


01:31:30.500 --> 01:31:33.400
How does a warrior
break his word of honor?


01:31:35.100 --> 01:31:38.400
You know the story about
the scorpion and the frog?


01:31:38.500 --> 01:31:40.100
- Yeah.
- Well, that's me.


01:31:40.100 --> 01:31:41.800
l'm the fucking bad guy.


01:31:41.900 --> 01:31:43.400
Yeah? Well, l'm the good guy.


01:32:08.600 --> 01:32:10.900
Hi.


01:32:11.000 --> 01:32:13.200
You all right?


01:32:40.500 --> 01:32:43.800
Make sure that's set right.
Got a long trip.


01:32:46.400 --> 01:32:49.200
Well, l need a minute
with you, brother.


01:32:49.200 --> 01:32:51.200
Yeah, l got a minute.
What you got?


01:32:51.300 --> 01:32:53.700
You know, this whole thing
was about money--


01:32:53.700 --> 01:32:55.700
$200 million.


01:32:55.800 --> 01:32:59.400
l got the bank accounts
with all the numbers right here.


01:32:59.400 --> 01:33:02.600
lt's all black ops money,


01:33:02.600 --> 01:33:05.000
all off the books.


01:33:05.000 --> 01:33:07.300
Ain't nobody to give it back to.


01:33:07.300 --> 01:33:09.300
l'm giving you half.


01:33:10.900 --> 01:33:12.700
What do you want to do
with it, man?


01:33:12.800 --> 01:33:16.200
Shit, probably use half of it
for some paybacks.


01:33:16.200 --> 01:33:19.200
Yeah, l'd like that myself.


01:33:20.500 --> 01:33:24.000
Maybe use the other half
to start up a security company,


01:33:24.100 --> 01:33:26.500
buy some toys.


01:33:26.600 --> 01:33:28.200
What the hell
are you gonna do?


01:33:28.300 --> 01:33:32.100
l think l'll give half
to St. Jude's in Memphis.


01:33:32.100 --> 01:33:34.500
The other half l'll use
to have some fun,


01:33:34.500 --> 01:33:37.300
help some of my friends
and my family.


01:33:38.500 --> 01:33:41.100
Listen, in about 48 hours, man,


01:33:41.100 --> 01:33:42.800
after you finish your thing,


01:33:42.800 --> 01:33:44.800
l was hoping you could meet me
in Port D'Azul.


01:33:44.900 --> 01:33:46.400
You know that place,
don't you?


01:33:46.400 --> 01:33:49.200
Yeah, l know the place.


01:33:49.200 --> 01:33:51.600
lt's where we used to do
the mission debriefs.


01:33:51.600 --> 01:33:54.300
What the hell are you
cooking up now?


01:33:54.400 --> 01:33:56.900
l got another operation for us.


01:33:57.000 --> 01:33:59.000
l think you're gonna like it.


01:33:59.100 --> 01:34:01.100
Remember, man,


01:34:01.100 --> 01:34:04.100
it ain't over till we're dead.


01:34:08.900 --> 01:34:11.900
l hope you like to fly, baby,
'cause it's time to go.

